      176.49,
      224.33,
      387.18,
      246.59
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE LAND (RESTRICTIONS ON ALIENATION)ACT, NO. 38 OF 2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      257.33,
      401.9,
      279.59
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      290.33,
      401.94,
      334.67
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Land (Restrictions onAlienation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2016 and shall bedeemed to have come into operation with effect fromJanuary 1, 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      345.29,
      401.88,
      389.63
    ],
    "text": "2.The following section is hereby inserted immediatelyafter section 5 of the Land (Restrictions on Alienation) Act,No. 38 of 2014 and shall have effect as section 5A of thatAct:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      214.89,
      400.25,
      401.89,
      444.59
    ],
    "text": "5A. Notwithstanding anything to the contraryin any of the provisions of this Act, theprovisions relating to the Land Lease Tax shallnot apply to a lease of any land\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      225.57,
      455.33,
      313.3,
      466.67
    ],
    "text": "(a)to a foreigner; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      225.57,
      477.29,
      401.87,
      532.67
    ],
    "text": "(b)to a company incorporated in Sri Lankaunder the Companies Act, where anyforeign shareholding in such company,either direct or indirect, is fifty per centor above; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      226.29,
      543.29,
      334.31,
      554.63
    ],
    "text": "(c)to a foreign company,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      214.89,
      565.25,
      401.88,
      620.63
    ],
    "text": "under and indenture of lease executed on orafter January 1, 2016, and accordingly the LandLease Tax shall not be charged, levied orcollected from any such person or company onor after such date.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      631.25,
      401.87,
      654.23
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
